      "controles": {
        "web": "Now in the first year of Cyrus king of Persia, that Yahweh’s word  by the mouth of Jeremiah might be accomplished, Yahweh stirred up the spirit of Cyrus king of Persia, so that he made a proclamation throughout all his kingdom, and put it also in writing, saying,",
        "kjv": "Now in the first year of Cyrus king of Persia, that the word of the Lord by the mouth of Jeremiah might be fulfilled, the Lord stirred up the spirit of Cyrus king of Persia, that he made a proclamation throughout all his kingdom, and put it also in writing, saying,",
        "livre": "No primeiro ano de Ciro rei da Pérsia, para que se cumprisse a palavra do SENHOR pela boca de Jeremias, o SENHOR despertou o espírito de Ciro rei da Pérsia, o qual mandou proclamar por todo o seu reino, e também por escrito, dizendo:"
      }
